## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Prerequisites
* **Python 3.10+**
* **Node.js 18+** & `npm` / `yarn`

### 2. Installation & Setup

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/1324Sa/ai-code-analyst.git](https://github.com/1324Sa/ai-code-analyst.git)
cd ai-code-analyst

# Setup Python Virtual Environment
python -m venv venv
# On Windows:
.\venv\Scripts\activate
# On Linux/macOS:
source venv/bin/activate

# Install Dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
npm install
